WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A project pitch makes assumptions, exclusions, options and uncertainty visible. It is a learning estimate, not financial advice.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Show base estimate, reserve, largest uncertainty and one lower-cost alternative on the same page.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
AP finance brief

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
These are teaching relationships, not live prices, quotes, tax advice or a forecast. State every assumption.

